\par\par \b \uc2 NZ dollar ends lower on spectre of  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .  \b0\par\par\uc2 452 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 2004\par 06:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     AUCKLAND, Feb 20 (Reuters) - The spectre of possible\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  put a dent in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 New Zealand\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar\par on Friday in a thin market generally considered to be long\par kiwi.\par     By 6:00 p.m (0500 GMT) the kiwi was at $0.6968/78, well off\par its session high of $0.7035 after a wire service reported New\par Zealand Finance Minister Michael Cullen as repeating comments\par that raising the level of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves by Reserve\par Bank of NZ could limit the kiwi's appreciation.\par  \par     The comments prompted profit-taking in a thin Friday market\par caught long kiwi and short U.S. dollars.\par     But future \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in kiwi is not seen as\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 being beyond the realms of possibility, as such a move would  \f28 \par \par \uc2 bring New Zealand into line with most central banks around the  \par \par \uc2 world.  \par \par \uc2 "A lot of people for a long time have considered the kiwi a  \par \par \uc2 one-way bet," Basil Payn, head of spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at  \par \par \uc2 Westpac Institutional Bank, said.  \par \par \uc2 "If New Zealand was to look at raising the levels of its  \par \par \uc2 reserves, which is quite a legitimate policy, it could slow the  \par \par \uc2 kiwi down a bit or even put a bit of downward pressure on it,"  \par \par \uc2 he said.  \par \par \uc2 Since floating in 1985 the Reserve Bank has steadfastly  \par \par \uc2 resisted the temptation to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 market.  \par \par \uc2 One of the factors seen behind driving demand for kiwi -  \par \par \uc2 New Zealand's high interest rates - might be diminishing, BNZ  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist Sue Trinh said.  \par \par \uc2 Industry figures showing a flattening out in national house  \par \par \uc2 prices and sales in January, the second flat month in a row,  \par \par \uc2 suggested slowing in the domestic economy and less need for  \par \par \uc2 further interest rate rises.  \par \par \uc2 "It is now the case that the March 11 MPS (monetary policy  \par \par \uc2 statement) is looking like the last near-term opportunity for a  \par \par \uc2 rate increase from the RBNZ, which also suggests the NZD's  \par \par \uc2 period of significant out-performance on the crosses may be  \par \par \uc2 nearing an exhaustion point," she said in a commentary.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     A new Reuters poll shows increasing doubt among forecasters\par on whether the Reserve Bank of NZ will raise rates next month.\par     Eight of 13 surveyed expect a 25 basis point hike,\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 previously there was unanimity, and the odds of a hike are now  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 put at only 55 percent against the previous survey's 70  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 percent.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Bonds were little changed in thin dealing, responding\par little to strength offshore.\par     Among the movements, February 2005 bond yields were at 5.49\par percent and November 2006s at 5.57 percent, both one tick\par higher.\par     July 2009s were up one at 5.74 percent and April 2013s up\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 two at 5.90.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040220e02k000k0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
