\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-INTERVIEW-NZD too high against Aussie dlr - NZ FinMin. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Graeme Peters \par \uc2 538 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Dezember 2002\par 04:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WELLINGTON, Dec 5 (Reuters) - New Zealand Finance Minister Michael Cullen said on Thursday the kiwi dollar was rising too far against the Australian dollar, but was not overpriced against the greenback. \par \par \uc2  Cullen said New Zealand manufacturing exporters would be more comfortable if the kiwi  retreated at least five percent from near five-year highs around 89.5 Australian cents. \par \par \uc2  "It (NZD) still is very much at the top end of the comfort zone on the Australian cross rate," Cullen told Reuters in an interview. \par \par \uc2  The comments blunted buying interest in the rising \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , taking kiwi off local session highs against both \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The kiwi was getting paid up to the low $0.5030s and as soon as the Cullen comments hit the wires it certainly took the sting out of the market and tempered buying interest," said Bank of New Zealand \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist Stuart Ritson. \par \par \uc2  However Cullen's influence on exchange rates is seen as limited to talk, Ritson said. \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's independent \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has never \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in 1984. \par \par \uc2  FLYING KIWI \par \par \uc2  Kiwi has risen 20 percent against the greenback since the start of this year and is up nearly 10 percent against the Australian dollar, an appreciation which has cut incomes of New Zealand exporters. \par \par \uc2  "They (manufacturing exporters) would be happier if we were down more around that A$0.85 or a bit below zone," Cullen said. \par \par \uc2  Australia is New Zealand's largest trading partner, taking about a fifth of the country's NZ$32 billion of exports, while the United States takes about 15 percent. \par \par \uc2  But Cullen said kiwi's  current level against the greenback at around 50 U.S. cents did not seem to be an issue. \par \par \uc2  "That's not high...We are certainly not outside anything like the long-term equilibrium rate," he said. \par \par \uc2  WARM WELCOME \par \par \uc2  Cullen said he was satisfied with the performance of new Reserve Bank of New Zealand Governor Alan Bollard and his \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of monetary policy under new guidelines. \par \par \uc2  "I have every impression that he is going well. People have confidence in his judgment," he said. \par \par \uc2  The revised agreement specifies an inflation target of one-to-three percent on average over the medium term, from the previous zero-to-three percent range. \par \par \uc2  Bollard's first two interest rate reviews have left the official cash rate stable at 5.75 percent. \par \par \uc2  Cullen said official growth and fiscal forecasts would be revised higher in the December Economic and Fiscal Update due on December 19. \par \par \uc2  "The overall numbers will be stronger than the pre-election fiscal update," Cullen said, referring to official forecasts issued in June. \par \par \uc2  Cullen said it was possible gross domestic product would grow four percent in the year to March, compared with 3.1 percent forecast in June. \par \par \uc2  However the current account deficit, which has influenced the kiwi's strength, was forecast to grow from its current 2.5 percent of gross domestic product. \par \par \uc2  "It is certainly again getting towards the outer reach of what you might regard as the comfort zone," he said, adding that a deficit above five percent of GDP was not desirable. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021205dyc5005pu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
