\par\par \b \uc2  NZ Brash:NZD Would Fall If Prices Rise And No Rate Hike \b0\par\par\uc2 490 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Oktober 2000\par 02:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WELLINGTON -(Dow Jones)- New Zealand Reserve Bank Governor Don Brash said Thursday the New Zealand dollar's fall to historic lows this week was due to a mix of factors, but that much of the fall was a reversal of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's overvaluation in the late 1990s. \par \par \uc2  In a speech entitled "The fall of the New Zealand dollar: What has happened and what does it mean," delivered to a meeting of the American Chamber of Commerce in Auckland, Brash said that there was no quick or easy way to reverse the New Zealand dollar's decline. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Brash said no one could tell whether the New Zealand dollar would fall\par further in the short term but over the long term he expected it to\par strengthen.\par - - 05/10/00 00-19G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In large part, the fall in the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is due to the strength\par of the U.S. dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The weak dollar also reflects New Zealand's large current account\par deficit, the fact New Zealand is viewed as an old-style economy, that\par New Zealand interest rates are comparable to those in major capital\par markets and some nervousness - whether warranted or not - about the\par policy direction of the Labour Party/Alliance Party coalition\par government, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The New Zealand dollar fell to an all-time low of US$0.3992 Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "There is no single, simple explanation for the fall in the New\par Zealand dollar over the last two years," Brash said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Since it hit a peak of US$0.7100 in November 1996, the New Zealand\par dollar has fallen 44%, he said. On its trade-weighted index, the dollar\par has fallen 32% from 69.00 in late April 1997 to around 47.00 this month,\par he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "A significant part of the depreciation since early 1997 had been the\par reversal of an overvalued \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par There appears to be little risk the fall in the exchange rate will\par adversely impact New Zealand's financial system, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par And Brash also noted there could be positive outcomes from the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's fall.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The low New Zealand dollar is likely to significantly reduce the\par current account deficit and shift economic activity into exports.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "It may well lead to a somewhat faster rate of growth in the medium\par term," he said.\par - - 05/10/00 00-29G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par If the low New Zealand dollar results in upward pressure on prices,\par the Reserve Bank would tighten, thereby increasing unemployment, and\par slowing growth temporarily, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par However, failure to tighten if inflation took hold would likely cause\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to fall further, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Brash said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would only \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market if trading in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 New Zealand\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar was disorderly, but\par that isn't the case at present.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By John Barton, Dow Jones Newswires; 644 8018960;\par john.barton@dowjones.com\par -0- 05/10/00 00-32G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dwa504ud8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
