\par\par \b \uc2  NZ Cullen, Brash Repeat Opposition To  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 181 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Mai 2000\par 01:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WELLINGTON -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Reserve Bank Governor Don Brash and Finance Minister Michael Cullen Tuesday reiterated their belief that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market isn't very useful. \par \par \uc2  Brash told reporters the international experience suggests that it isn't very useful for central banks to directly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, but there can't be any harm in the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  offering its views on the issue. \par \par \uc2  The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't used its reserves to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets since 1985, and the country's political parties also oppose the idea of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  Cullen, speaking to reporters with Brash after announcing details of a review of the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of monetary policy, reiterated that viewpoint. \par \par \uc2  "I would be very surprised if the reviewer would have in mind to recommend that we went into direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and it would take an awful lot of convincing of me to suggest that we ought to be doing that," Cullen said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw58029rf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
