2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, has been regarded to have one of the cleanest floats in the world. Despite Monday's change, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has assured it will maintain its non-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 08-02-99 \par \par \uc2  2222GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv28010vr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
