\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -3: NZD Surges Amid  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Policy Change \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Februar 1999\par 23:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  While the commodity \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  staged some strong performances last week, the New Zealand dollar alone was able to sustain it upward momentum Monday. \par \par \uc2  It surged to new nine-month highs after the Reserve Bank of New Zealand's surprise switch on monetary policy implementation opened the way for higher interest rates. \par \par \uc2  Around 2100 GMT, the New Zealand dollar is quoted at US$0.5568, down slightly from its close Monday in Wellington of US$0.5588, but up from US$0.5524 late Friday in Wellington. \par \par \uc2  The New Zealand dollar hadn't closed as high since April 27 last year. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the announcement the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had abandoned the monetary conditions index in favor of an official cash rate immediately underpinned the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as 90-day interest rates rose to 4.30% from 4.08% late Friday. \par \par \uc2  Expectations the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will seek to raise rates even further in March gave further support to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Under the new policy, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it will continue to take account of the impact of the exchange rate on monetary policy as it has in the past, and argues that the new implementation policy will reduce volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2 , due to its policy of non-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, has been regarded to have one of the cleanest floats in the world. Despite Monday's change, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has assured it will maintain its non-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 08-02-99 \par \par \uc2  2219GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 1865 20714 28038 4164 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv28010vk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
