\par\par \b \uc2  NZ Dollar Dn In Early Trading; Market Uncertainty Noted \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 August 1998\par 22:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WELLINGTON (Dow Jones)--The New Zealand dollar is lower in local morning trade Tuesday, with dealers saying investors remain nervous on the back of overnight volatility in world markets which saw the U.S.-based Dow Jones Industrial Average plunge more than 500 points or about 6.4% in value. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the uncertainty in world markets, related to the Russian economic and political crisis, means investors in the local market are unwilling to take strong positions and are instead trading on a short-term basis while watching further developments overseas. \par \par \uc2  Around 2045 GMT the New Zealand dollar was quoted at US$0.4947, down from US$0.4954 late Monday in Wellington. \par \par \uc2  The New Zealand \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded in a range of US$0.4938 to US$0.4960 overnight. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the local unit looks heavy in early Tuesday trade on the back of global volatility in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , share and debt markets. \par \par \uc2  "The Dow Jones has plunged, U.S. treasurys have rallied quite a long way. So there is just global expectations of weaker markets," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "There's no reason for any \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to tighten conditions," he added. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar will likely move in a range of US$0.4910 to US$0.4960 Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "The New Zealand \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is looking a little bit offered. It will struggle to move up through the US$0.4980 level," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 31-08-98 \par \par \uc2  2053GMT \par \par \uc2  1062 20711 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8v07hd7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
