r the next year, and falling local interest rates over the next 18 months. \par \par \uc2  "The New Zealand dollar is weaker first off Monday, with the troubles on the world markets Friday night not helping the unit," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "Those troubles combined with the monetary policy statement Thursday means it is pretty hard to see too much upside in the New Zealand unit," he added. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 23-08-98 \par \par \uc2  2121GMT \par \par \uc2  1062 20711 \par \par \uc2 Dokument djan000020010916du8n003fl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
