\par\par \b \uc2  NZ dollar falls to 11-1/2 year low, under US$0.50. \b0\par\par\uc2 315 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Juni 1998\par 00:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WELLINGTON, June 10 (Reuters) - The New Zealand dollar, which has been trading around 5-1/2 year lows against the U.S dollar for several days, slipped below a key level of US$0.5010 in Wednesday trade and reached levels not seen since late 1986. \par \par \uc2  A dip to just under US$0.5000 at about 10.40 a.m. (2240 GMT), took it to levels last seen on October 17, 1986, according to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data. \par \par \uc2  On that date the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  last closed under 50 U.S. cents at US$0.4997. \par \par \uc2  The slip, which came in tandem with a move by the Australian dollar below US$0.59, followed a comment earlier in the morning by the Reserve Bank of New Zealand that it would like to see New Zealand monetary conditions clos. \par \par \uc2  According to bank records, the TWI was last at around these levels in May 1994 when it hit 56.47. \par \par \uc2  The trade-weighted all-time low was hit on January 3, 1992, when it touched 52.74. \par \par \uc2  The spot kiwi's all-time low against the U.S. dollar comes from the time of its float, on March 4, 1985, when it hit US$0.4365. \par \par \uc2  Both the Australian and New Zealand \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued to stray below their respective key levels at 10.58 a.m. (2258 GMT), with the kiwi trading at US$0.4980/87 and the Aussie at US$0.5873/78. \par \par \uc2  Traders in Australia reported the usual rumours of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of Australia. \par \par \uc2  The RBNZ has never \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and according to \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  politicians this week there is no political desire here to start doing so. \par \par \uc2  ((Wellington newsroom tel +64 4 473 4746, fax +64 4 473 6212 wellington.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du69039ou\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
