of note, the Economist magazine's annual 'Big Mac' index of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  values implied the New Zealand dollar was 26% undervalued against the U.S. dollar. The magazine said the U.S. dollar was worth NZ$1.35 compared to an actual exchange rate of NZ$1.82. \par \par \uc2  -By Karen Chan; 644-801-8960; email kchan@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 14-04-98 \par \par \uc2  0608GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du4e0333m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
