\par\par \b \uc2  NZ Dollar Slightly Higher In Quiet Late Trade; RBNZ Watched \b0\par\par\uc2 440 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Juni 1997\par 07:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WELLINGTON (AP-Dow Jones)--The New Zealand dollar was slightly higher in quiet late trading Tuesday, with the potential for Reserve Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  remaining the focus. \par \par \uc2  Around 0525 GMT, the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is quoted at US$0.6904, up from its previous close late Monday in Wellington, but down from its local open at US$0.6910. \par \par \uc2  The New Zealand \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded in a range of US$0.6897 to US$0.6910 Tuesday. Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  drifted back over the afternoon in a thin market. \par \par \uc2  They anticipate the New Zealand dollar will likely move in another narrow range of US$0.6895 to US$0.6910 overnight. \par \par \uc2  'But we're expecting buying at some stage during the week from a NZ$500 Eurokiwi, so it's well bid around these levels,' a local broker said. \par \par \uc2  Fannie Mae of the U.S. offered NZ$500 million of New Zealand dollar global bonds with a 7.25% coupon late Friday, following two Eurokiwi issues totaling NZ$200 million earlier last week. \par \par \uc2  And Germany's Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz Girozentrale issued a NZ$100 million Eurokiwi at 7.25% overnight Monday. \par \par \uc2  Attention, however, largely remains on the Reserve Bank with monetary conditions still looser than levels at which it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  a few weeks ago. \par \par \uc2  Against its trade weighted index, the New Zealand dollar is 67.22, down from 67.25 late Monday and down from 67.25 early Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  When the debt market closed at 0430 GMT, the TWI was at 67.17 and the differential between the 90-day bank bill yield implied by the conditions desired by the Reserve Bank in March and the actual yield was 100 basis points. \par \par \uc2  On May 12 the Reserve Bank called for firmer conditions when the differential was between 85 to 90 basis points. \par \par \uc2  'We're closing in on the 27th very quickly,' noted one broker. 'Unless it blows out to maybe 105 or 110 and stays there a few days, I think the Reserve Bank will wait...but we are definitely keeping our eyes open.' \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is presenting its six-monthly Monetary Policy Statement on June 27. \par \par \uc2  On a cross-rate with the neighboring Australian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the local dollar is quoted at A$0.9072, down from A$0.9075 late Monday and down from A$0.9074 early Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  On a cross-rate with the Japanese yen, the local dollar was quoted at Y77.92, up from Y77.82 late Monday and down from Y77.98 early Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 10-06-97 \par \par \uc2  0533GMT \par \par \uc2  1062 20711 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt6a047y3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
