\par\par \b \uc2  NZ Brash Repeats RBNZ Retains  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  Option \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Mai 1997\par 03:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WELLINGTON (AP-Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank is maintaining a reasonably liquid portfolio of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves in case a future government instructs it to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, Governor Don Brash told Parliament's Finance & Expenditure Committee Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In a briefing to the multi-party grouping, Brash reiterated his \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to research the practicalities of direct foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as well as the opportunity costs associated with maintaining but not using the reserves. \par \par \uc2  'I have said publicly in the past that we for example have given some consideration as to whether direct \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might be (of assistance to the conduct of smooth monetary policy in New Zealand),' Brash said. 'At this point we are not persuaded it would work effectively although we are still doing research on overseas countries' experience on that.' \par \par \uc2  The Reserve Bank has not directly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since the \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar was floated in 1985. \par \par \uc2  Brash said it was a government policy decision as to whether officials should \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. But in the meantime his \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  maintains appropriately liquid foreign reserves to ensure the option remains open. \par \par \uc2  Treasurer Winston Peters and Finance Minister Bill Birch have previously condemned opposition Labour Party calls for direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0121GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt57038sb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
