\par\par \b \uc2  NZ Desire For Lower Dollar Unlikely From  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2  By Ed Lane \par \uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 1996\par 22:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WELLINGTON (AP-Dow Jones)--The push by politicians and Reserve Bank of New Zealand Governor Don Brash for a weaker New Zealand dollar is highly unlikely to come from selling the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , senior policy analysts say. \par \par \uc2  With the New Zealand dollar near eight-year highs against the U.S. dollar and its trade-weighted index (TWI), exporters have led a concerted call for a lower \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is reluctant to allow lower interest rates to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower because of its concerns a drop in interest rates would make it harder to get back to the middle of its mandated 0% to 2% annual underlying inflation goal. \par \par \uc2  In response, some analysts have called for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell the New Zealand dollar into the market in what is known as a sterilized \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Grant Spencer, treasurer with ANZ Banking Group NZ Ltd., said the action would have a short-term effect driving the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lower and interest rates higher. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would sell \b \highlight22\uc2 New Zealand\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollars and likely buy U.S. Treasurys if it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but it would soak up the excess liquidity created by issuing government-backed Treasury bills. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was floated in March 1985, and Spencer said 'if something came out of the blue' and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  suddenly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  it would have a major impact. \par \par \uc2  But he said he highly doubted such a move is being contemplated by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-11-96 \par \par \uc2  2135GMT \par \par \uc2  1199 20713 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsbd00v4r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
